a maximum injection time of 50 ms. Precursor ions with charge states 3-8 were fragmented by CID at 35 % collision in a data dependent mode. The exclusion duration of dynamic exclusion is 60s and spectra were analyzed in the ion trap with rapid scan rate.\n'}], 'model': 'gpt-5.4-nano-2026-03-17', 'store': True, 'temperature': 0.3}}
